{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-500245: qemu-kvm security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[7.2.0-43.el9]\n- dmg: reject inconsistent UDRW chunk sector count and length (CVE-2026-65928) (Stefan Hajnoczi) [Orabug: 39849788] {CVE-2026-65928}\n- dmg: fix out-of-bounds load in search_chunk() (CVE-2026-65929) (Stefan Hajnoczi) [Orabug: 39849747] {CVE-2026-65929}\n- virtio: avoid packed vring virtio_queue_empty() infinite loops (CVE-2026-16457) (Stefan Hajnoczi) [Orabug: 39844863] {CVE-2026-16457}\n- hw/net/virtio-net: Protect from DMA re-entrancy bugs (Laurent Vivier) [Orabug: 39843811] {CVE-2026-66022}\n- libvduse: validate vq size (Michael S. Tsirkin) [Orabug: 39825932] {CVE-2026-61402}\n- libvhost-user: fix heap overflow in vu_check_queue_inflights (Michael S. Tsirkin) [Orabug: 39843801] {CVE-2026-63110}\n- libvhost-user: validate last_batch_head in vu_check_queue_inflights (Michael S. Tsirkin) [Orabug: 39843801] {CVE-2026-63110}\n- virtio-net: fix short frame OOB read in receive_filter() (Michael S. Tsirkin) [Orabug: 39843795] {CVE-2026-63320}\n- hw/9pfs: fix O_TRUNC bypass on read-only export (Christian Schoenebeck) [Orabug: 39804678] {CVE-2026-63318}\n- hw/usb/hcd-xhci-sysbus: Fix OOB heap access in xhci_sysbus_intr_raise() (Thomas Huth) [Orabug: 39793551] {CVE-2026-16043}\n- usbredir: fix use-after-free on buffered bulk packet overflow (Marc-Andre Lureau) [Orabug: 39793554] {CVE-2026-15705}\n- ui/vnc: validate SetPixelFormat field ranges (Marc-Andre Lureau) [Orabug: 39804658] {CVE-2026-15578}\n- target/i386: add compatibility property for arch_capabilities (Paolo Bonzini) [Orabug: 39935277]\n- hw/i386: Add pc-q35-7.2-exadata-v2 machine (Mark Kanda) [Orabug: 39917084]",
